     1	"""Serving while a stored-answer replay writes (D573; $0). The extension proof's draw is judged again through the accepted loop
     2	(D567) into a new scratch store, to an end day past its due days; every judge request is answered from the stored archive by
     3	identity, and a request with none stops the run. At fixed pauses inside the loop (before a day's judging round, before its
     4	closing and completion, after them) the product's API, started on the store being written, is asked for `/days` and `/library`,
     5	and a fresh page pointed at it is rendered in headless Chrome. It exits 1 unless every check holds.
     6	
     7	  python3 serving_while_writing.py <extension proof folder> <new scratch folder> [end day]
